        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DKV6R, Rope Solid Brass Door Knocker With Peephole</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis victorian rope design viewer door knocker includes a 180 degree glass lens viewer for added home security. Now you can safely see who is at your door before you open it. The peephole eye viewer has a 1/2\" diameter shaft. The victorian viewer door knocker is made from solid brass and is available in 9 great finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"325\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DKV6R-Specifications.gif?v=1704354588\" width=\"325\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DKV6R Viewer Door Knocker Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIt is thru-bolt mounted with 3-7/8\" center to center mounting holes (distance between the 2 mounting bolt holes). Includes two matching finish 6 mm thread by 2-7/8\" long screws with decorative screw cap nuts for easy installation. This victorian design door knocker features the distinctive rope pattern in 3 locations. The rope design that is both classic and sophisticated. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana DKV6R Rope Viewer Door Knocker:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 3-7/8\" c.c. (distance between the 2 mounting screw holes)</li>\r\n<li>Max Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Type: Thru-Bolted (screws go thru the door)</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish mounting hardware and eye viewer.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DKV6R.pdf?v=1704262209\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DKV6R Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Victorian Rope Viewer Door Knocker, Deltana DKV6R",
                "description": "Victorian Rope Viewer Door Knocker Deltana DKV6R - This victorian rope design viewer door knocker includes a 180 degree glass lens viewer for added home security. Now you can safely see who is at your door before you open it. The peephole eye viewer has a 1/2 inch diameter shaft. The victorian viewer door knocker is made from solid brass and is available in 9 great finishes. It is thru-bolt mounted with 3-7/8 inch center to center mounting holes (distance between the 2 mounting bolt holes). Includes two matching finish 6 mm thread by 2-7/8 inch long screws with decorative screw cap nuts for easy installation. This victorian design door knocker features the distinctive rope pattern in 3 locations. The rope design that is both classic and sophisticated. ",
                "keywords": "DEL-DKV6R Victorian Rope Viewer Door Knockers, Deltana DKV6R   Brass Victorian Door Knocker, rubbed bronze, doorknockers, viewer knocker, knocker with viewer,  sight glass, glass lens, door viewer, peepholes, peek holes, peep holes, Victorian Rope Style Eye Viewer Knockers,"
